  "eventSemantics": {
    "Pilot check invariance": "Force Pilot only substitutes the Pilot skill modifier. The check is still classified Pilot, so the natural-20 restoration rule and Force Reflexes remain eligible.",
    "Gunner check invariance": "Gunner maneuvers make/consume weapon attack rolls. Neither Force Pilot nor Force Reflexes substitutes or rerolls a weapon attack.",
    "Force maneuver invariance": "Target Sense uses Use the Force; not Pilot. It may benefit from UTF-specific feats but not Pilot-only rerolls or nat-20 Pilot suite recovery.",
    "Corellian Slip errata": "Follow-up attack is free action after entering square. Errata has precedence over first printing.",
    "Fighter-group errata": "Every group member must know maneuver, must use it together, and joining a group terminates individually active attack patterns.",
    "Attack-pattern lifecycle": "Only one pattern active at a time. A new pattern replaces prior; old suite instance remains spent until recovered.",
    "Shared property rule": "No additional damage or action benefit is granted by source-name matching. Positive, negative and scoped influence edges apply only to explicitly matching typed targets."
  },
